SpriteLoom MCP

This integration builds on the SpriteLoom protocol and pixel-art workflow
created by Valentyn Karachevtsev (vkarach):
https://github.com/vkarach/spriteloom

The original SpriteLoom project is licensed under Apache License 2.0.
The separate spriteloom-mlx repository provides the Apple Silicon engine.
FLUX.2 Klein 4B weights are supplied by Black Forest Labs under their own
Apache License 2.0 release. Model weights are downloaded separately.

This is an independent integration. It is not an official release from
Valentyn Karachevtsev, Black Forest Labs, Anthropic, or OpenAI.
